CONTENTS OF published/

`published/eval_dataset.json` contains conversation text generated by third-party language
models (gpt-oss-120b, gpt-oss-20b, nemotron-lightning-3.5) acting inside tau3-bench
environments. Model outputs are subject to the terms of service of whichever provider produced
them, and the surrounding task, policy and persona material is tau2-bench's. Customer names,
addresses, emails and phone numbers appearing in these conversations are tau2-bench's synthetic
fixture data and do not refer to real people.

`published/evaluations_k3/` contains numeric scores only. No evaluator-generated text is
retained.

Model outputs in any run directory you generate yourself are likewise subject to the terms of
service of whichever provider produced them.
